<td><code>eq</code>, <code>ne</code>, <code>like</code>, <code>not-like</code>, <code>null</code>, <code>not-null</code>, <code>contains</code>, <code>not-contains</code>, <code>gt</code>, <code>ge</code>, <code>lt</code>, <code>le</code></td>
